sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant W as Worker (orders queue)
    participant S as Scheduler (reconcile, Task 9)
    participant X as Waxpeer

    Note over DB,W: Payment commits: order paid + NOTIFY orders
    DB-->>W: NOTIFY orders (or the poll tick)
    W->>DB: claim paid orders oldest first (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)<br/>→ buying, claimed_at/by, skin_trades (project_id = order id, buy_pending)
    W->>DB: commit

    loop each claimed order (its own transactions; one failure never stops the batch)
        W->>DB: take the lease first: UPDATE next_check_at = now + 5 min<br/>WHERE buying AND buy_pending AND due RETURNING (else nothing to do)
        W->>DB: read the snapshot (still buying + buy_pending? else release, nothing to do)
        Note over W: the attempt's budget (lease − 30 s) starts before the lease is taken
        Note over W,DB: once the buy is sent, an exit that did not record it → unconfirmed<br/>in a fresh session, or the lease is kept (lapses as a dead attempt's)
        alt trade link does not parse
            W->>DB: lock order → trade, re-check; failed + refund to balance (invalid_trade_link)
        else
            W->>X: check-many-project-id [order id]  (no lock held)
            alt 403
                W->>DB: lock, re-check; attention waxpeer_forbidden, buy_pending kept
            else unavailable / 429 / refused
                Note over W: lookup_later — nothing sent, retried next tick
            else a trade under our project_id
                W->>DB: lock, re-check; mirror it, buy_pending = false (adopted, never rebought)
            else several live trades
                W->>DB: lock, re-check; attention ambiguous_trade, buy_pending = false
            else none
                W->>X: buy-one-p2p (listing, paid_units, trade link, project_id)
                alt accepted
                    W->>DB: lock, re-check; waxpeer_id, bought_units, status 0, buy_pending = false
                else 403
                    W->>DB: attention waxpeer_forbidden, buy_pending kept (no refund)
                else 429
                    Note over W: rate_limited — buy_pending kept, next tick retries
                else lost answer / unreadable / 5xx / any unexpected error or timeout
                    W->>DB: buy_unconfirmed_at, buy_pending = false (resolved by lookup, R3)
                else refused (sold, price moved, 4xx)
                    W->>X: GET /v1/user when the refusal does not name low balance
                    alt low balance
                        W->>DB: failed + refund to balance (waxpeer_low_balance)
                    else first refusal
                        W->>X: listings (cached, budgeted read): cheapest other auto ≤ paid × 1.03
                        W->>X: buy-one-p2p (the substitute), once
                    end
                    opt nothing bought
                        W->>DB: failed + refund to balance (sold_out)
                    end
                end
            end
        end
        Note over W,DB: a buy that went through but finds the rows moved → attention ambiguous_trade (stale_bought)
        W->>DB: release the lease (next_check_at = now, only if still this attempt's)
    end

    S->>DB: due buying orders with buy_pending → the same attempt (lease first)
